    {
      "name": "plan_shufersal_replenishment",
      "description": "Plan office replenishment without changing the cart. Select 2–8 representative delivered order numbers from history; do not assume listing order is chronological. Map the user stock update to exact product IDs and selling methods. Unlisted stock stays unknown unless the user explicitly says it is empty. Optional target overrides the historical median. Existing cart quantities count toward the target and are never removed.",
