      "description": "Only after explicit owner approval of the prepared revision and absolute targets: record acceptance of current state, preserving unknown history. Targets may replace the original SKU, or be empty to abandon it; the original target is never replayed. Supply the owner's identity and approval message/reference, never fabricate approval or infer it from general automation permission. Owner must acknowledge outstanding requests investigated and unknown outcome. Does not modify cart. CART_CHANGED requires a fresh prepare and new approval. Client is responsible for authenticating owner approval.",
